      "witness": "Under the default known policy view and XV, a cancel-pending order fills at 343 ms, with notification due 443 ms. With identical public frames/predictions, the filled branch sends a placement at 353 ms and the no-fill branch does not. The public frames received after the fill carry pre-fill timestamps 309/320/331/342 ms. Cancel-effect time for the filled order is 380 ms, also after the divergent request.",
      "configuration": "MICRO / AV:5:25:0.06 / G1+G2+G3+G4+G5+G6+V0+GS+XNA+XMIN1+XV+S60; flat Binance; positive depth; actual 44 ms unanswered-request cap and default token budget; no artificial budget overrides.",
